'''Darkknife''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 25th tier in the Battle Pass during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh, but it entirely black. The right side of the blade has black swirls on it and its handle is covered in black bars. The guard is also black.

== Trivia ==
It has a partner gun under the name [[Darkgun]].

